WEBVTT

00:19:29.586 --> 00:19:30.988
and I came off the stage

00:19:31.012 --> 00:19:34.360
and spent the entire rest of that week

00:19:34.384 --> 00:19:38.820
absolutely besieged by all
the other attendees at the conference

00:19:38.844 --> 00:19:40.059
who all wanted to tell me

00:19:40.083 --> 00:19:44.093
that what you just described
is their living reality.

00:19:44.117 --> 00:19:48.782
It describes so many people
for whom you would least expect it.

00:19:48.806 --> 00:19:50.376
CA: Well, so, first of all,

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:52.033
we not only made you do a talk,

00:19:52.057 --> 00:19:55.268
we then put you through hell
of being besieged by many, many people.

00:19:55.292 --> 00:19:58.231
SC: No, no! Well, this is the thing --
I actually loved that,

00:19:58.255 --> 00:20:00.640
because I really love to be able
to talk to people